#. cultivate_region.csv: A Gold-element cave dwelling deep in the Qingfe...
msgid "CULTIVATE_REGION_201_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A Gold-element cave dwelling deep in the Qingfeng Mountains, where Gold "
"essence qi condenses and the sound of swords never ceases; it is the supreme"
" holy land for Gold-attribute cultivators."

#. cultivate_region.csv: Taibai Gold Mansion
msgid "CULTIVATE_REGION_201_NAME"
msgstr "Taibai Gold Mansion"

#. cultivate_region.csv: A Wood-element cave dwelling in the Qingyun For...
msgid "CULTIVATE_REGION_202_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A Wood-element cave dwelling in the Qingyun Forest, full of vitality and "
"spiritual herbs; it is the supreme holy land for Wood-attribute cultivators."

#. cultivate_region.csv: Qingmu Grotto-Heaven
msgid "CULTIVATE_REGION_202_NAME"
msgstr "Qingmu Grotto-Heaven"

#. cultivate_region.csv: A Water-element cave dwelling deep in the bound...
msgid "CULTIVATE_REGION_203_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A Water-element cave dwelling deep in the boundless azure sea, with ten "
"thousand miles of blue waves and Water essence for soul condensation; it is "
"the supreme holy land for Water-attribute cultivators."

#. cultivate_region.csv: Xuanshui Secret Realm
msgid "CULTIVATE_REGION_203_NAME"
msgstr "Xuanshui Secret Realm"

#. cultivate_region.csv: A Fire-element cave dwelling beside the Lava Vo...
msgid "CULTIVATE_REGION_204_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A Fire-element cave dwelling beside the Lava Volcano, with flames reaching "
"the sky and pure true fire; it is the supreme holy land for Fire-attribute "
"cultivators."

#. cultivate_region.csv: Lihuo Cave Dwelling
msgid "CULTIVATE_REGION_204_NAME"
msgstr "Lihuo Cave Dwelling"

#. cultivate_region.csv: A Earth-element cave dwelling in the Qingfeng M...
msgid "CULTIVATE_REGION_205_DESC"
msgstr ""
"A Earth-element cave dwelling in the Qingfeng Mountains, where thick earth "
"carries all things and mountains resonate; it is the supreme holy land for "
"Earth-attribute cultivators."

#. cultivate_region.csv: Houtu Mystic Palace
msgid "CULTIVATE_REGION_205_NAME"
msgstr "Houtu Mystic Palace"

#. cultivate_region.csv: Ancient ruins deep in the rainforest, with anci...
msgid "CULTIVATE_REGION_206_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Ancient ruins deep in the rainforest, with ancient vines entangling, where "
"Wood-element and Gold-element spiritual qi blend. Contains ancient "
"cultivation techniques and spiritual herb formulas."

#. cultivate_region.csv: Guyue Ruins
msgid "CULTIVATE_REGION_206_NAME"
msgstr "Guyue Ruins"

#. cultivate_region.csv: Ancient civilization ruins submerged in the sea...
msgid "CULTIVATE_REGION_207_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Ancient civilization ruins submerged in the sea, with dense Water-element "
"spiritual qi; treasures occasionally appear during the tides."

#. cultivate_region.csv: Canghai Ruins
msgid "CULTIVATE_REGION_207_NAME"
msgstr "Canghai Ruins"
